Intelligent customer profiling with behavior analysis and personalized suggestions.

This module provides:
- Recurrent customer detection (frequency analysis)
- Service preference learning (what they book most)
- Booking pattern recognition (preferred times/dates)
- Personalized recommendations (next likely service)
- Auto-completion of customer data
- VIP/Priority customer identification
- Risk detection (frequent cancellations, no-shows)
- Upsell opportunities (complementary services)

