─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GREETING:
  "¡{{ customer_name }}! ¡Bienvenido de vuelta! ⭐"

VIP TREATMENT:
  - Priority messaging (fast response)
  - Direct booking path (minimal steps)
  - Special pricing (if applicable)

DATA AUTO-COMPLETE:
