  "¿Quieres que te lo deje reservado?"


TIER 4: AT-RISK CUSTOMER (Needs Attention)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GREETING:
  "Hola {{ customer_name }}, ¡te echamos de menos! 💙"

RE-ENGAGEMENT TRIGGER:
  "No nos vemos desde hace {{ months_inactive }} meses."
  "¿Hay algo que no te haya funcionado?"

FRICTION REDUCTION:
  - Remove all non-essential fields
  - Simplify the booking process
  - Make cancellation policy clear (build trust)
  - Highlight easy rescheduling

PAIN POINT INQUIRY:
  "¿Hay algo que podamos mejorar en nuestro servicio?"
  [Feedback collection]

ALTERNATIVE OFFER:
  "Tal vez te interese otro servicio esta vez"
  "Basado en lo que ofrecemos, sugerimos..."

GENTLE REMINDERS:
  "Solo confirma cuando estés listo"
  "Sin presión, estamos aquí cuando lo necesites"

INCENTIVE (if available):
  "Para darte la bienvenida de vuelta: [Incentive]"
  "Válido solo para tu próxima reserva"

MANUAL ESCALATION FLAG:
  IF cancellation_rate > 50% OR no_shows > 2:
    → Log event: "Customer needs manual follow-up"
    → Flag for support team
    → Possible outreach: phone/email


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
🤖 IMPLEMENTATION: WHEN TO CALL get_customer_history()
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

TRIGGER POINTS:
1. Email identified or provided
2. Customer logs in / authenticated
3. User provides phone number that matches existing customer
4. Second turn in conversation with identified email

CALL TIMING:
❌ DON'T CALL: Before customer identifies themselves
❌ DON'T CALL: On every message (cache results in session)
✅ DO CALL: When email first provided/identified
✅ DO CALL: Cache result for duration of conversation

CACHING STRATEGY:
  customer_history = {
    email: "maria@gmail.com",
    profile_tier: "TIER_2",
    total_bookings: 4,
    preferred_service: "Consulta",
    preferred_day: "Miércoles",
    preferred_time: "10:00",
    cancellation_rate: 15%,
    days_since_last: 45,
    reliability: "MOSTLY_RELIABLE",
    fetched_at: now()
  }

  ✅ Reuse in current conversation (don't re-fetch)
  ✅ Fetch fresh on new session
  ✅ Cache max 24 hours (then refresh)


