📋 PERSONALIZATION CHECKLIST
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

When customer is identified, verify:

□ Retrieve customer history via get_customer_history(email)
  □ If found: Analyze data and assign TIER
  □ If not found: Treat as NEW CUSTOMER (TIER 1)

□ TIER 1 (New Customer):
  □ Warm welcome (fresh start)
  □ Show all services equally
  □ Ask all required fields
  □ Extra confirmation

□ TIER 2 (Recurring/Loyal):
  □ Personalized greeting with name
  □ Pre-fill email and name
  □ Suggest preferred service
  □ Suggest preferred time
  □ Offer speed path (confirm/change)

□ TIER 3 (Power/VIP):
  □ VIP greeting with special recognition
  □ Pre-fill all data (email, name, phone)
  □ Predict next service (high confidence)
  □ Predict preferred date/time
  □ Offer one-click booking
  □ Consider upsell/cross-sell
  □ Offer special pricing (if applicable)

□ TIER 4 (At-Risk):
  □ Warm re-engagement greeting
  □ Reduce friction (fewer fields)
  □ Ask about pain points
  □ Explain cancellation/rescheduling clearly
  □ Offer incentive (if applicable)
  □ Flag for manual follow-up (if severe risk)

□ All Tiers:
  □ Use customer name in messaging (when available)
  □ Match their communication style (short/long responses)
  □ Respect their preferences (time, service, style)
  □ Honor cancellation history (don't over-confirm)


